{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_01",
      "hash": "474d4bf0c26a7e54",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "CAPTAIN: Oooargh...\\nI feel terrible...\\r\\nUrrp! This seasickness...has done me in..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0430_sys_01",
      "hash": "e5d62e6437bebe1b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You rubbed the captain’s back!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0430_sys_03",
      "hash": "e5d6306437bec181",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There, there, old fellow..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_02",
      "hash": "474d4ef0c26a836d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "CAPTAIN: Whew! Thank you!\\nI’m feeling much better now."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_13",
      "hash": "4749c5f0c26764cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "So what did you want from me?\\c\\nOh, you want to learn my Secret Technique?\\c\\nOf course I’d be happy to teach it!\\nCome along with me..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0430_partner_a_01",
      "hash": "89fec1e6e8f7587a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pika pika!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0430_partner_b_01",
      "hash": "e333820030487eed",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Eeeveee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_07",
      "hash": "474d49f0c26a7aee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "CAPTAIN: Hahaha! That [VAR POKNAME(0002)] looks\\nmore than ready to learn my Secret Technique...\\r\\nBut I’m afraid it’s really only for humans!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_08",
      "hash": "474d44f0c26a726f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "What’s this?\\nYou really want to try to learn it, no matter what?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_14",
      "hash": "4749caf0c2676d4a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Well, color me surprised! I’ve traveled all over\\nthis wide world, and this is the first time I’ve had\\r\\na Pokémon want to learn my Secret Technique..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_12",
      "hash": "4749c4f0c2676318",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "But with spirit like that...\\nWell then, who am I to say no?\\c\\nI’ll teach my special Secret Technique even to\\nthat [VAR POKNAME(0002)] of yours!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_03",
      "hash": "474d4df0c26a81ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Come with me, little friend."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_04",
      "hash": "474d48f0c26a793b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Now watch carefully."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_09",
      "hash": "474d43f0c26a70bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "... ... ..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_10",
      "hash": "4749c6f0c267667e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 14]"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_11",
      "hash": "4749c7f0c2676831",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hyah! Dah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0430_partner_a_02",
      "hash": "89fec0e6e8f756c7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 16]"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0430_partner_b_02",
      "hash": "e3337f00304879d4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 17]"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0430_sys_02",
      "hash": "e5d62f6437bebfce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)] learned the [VAR COLOR(0006)]Secret Technique[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]Chop Down[VAR COLOR(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_05",
      "hash": "474d47f0c26a7788",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "CAPTAIN: Whoa-ho!\\nIt really went and learned Chop Down!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_15",
      "hash": "4749cbf0c2676efd",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Using Chop Down, your [VAR POKNAME(0002)] will be\\nable to help you chop down thin trees.\\c\\nYou could go give it a try, uh... That’s right!\\nHow about on the trees around Vermilion City?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_06",
      "hash": "474d4af0c26a7ca1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "CAPTAIN: Whew!\\c\\nNow I guess it’s about time for the S.S. Anne to\\nset sail again!\\c\\nThis may be good-bye for now. Until the next\\ntime we return to Vermilion City!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_seaman1_01_p05_cave_d0308",
      "hash": "5f5346594f04464d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 22]"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0430_max",
